{"channelId":"UCdZ93zOnstul7Yj86I1m1Sg","row":["Paisley's Corner - Educational Videos for Kids",378000,"Come learn through play with Silly Miss Lily in fun, family-friendly educational videos for kids. From baby and toddler learning to ages 1–5 and beyond, Paisley’s Corner offers fun learning adventures that are calm, engaging, and meaningful.\n\nWe explore science concepts like gravity, inertia, helicopters, and geodes, plus teach first words, baby sign language, ABCs, colors, shapes, nursery rhymes, and early reading, all in a safe, non-overstimulating space.\n\nCreated by a mom of two, homeschool teacher, and University of Washington business graduate, every video is thoughtfully designed to be educational, interactive, and parent-approved.\n\n💡 Gentle but engaging, our videos use repetition, pretend play, and simple activities to help toddlers and preschoolers learn naturally through play.\n\nWe believe kids are capable of learning so much, and when learning feels fun and calm, it sticks.\n\nSubscribe for family-friendly learning videos, toddler learning, and fun educational adventures 💛","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdZ93zOnstul7Yj86I1m1Sg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdZ93zOnstul7Yj86I1m1Sg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:27.767Z","channelId":"UCdZ93zOnstul7Yj86I1m1Sg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"0960357cd133d2019263b16b6e6633b977f3d41800b90cbdb2778fb5d9c5847f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"a24257ca09f5f6afcdb0414ba8e15962021f2701a977fbdfa04c1cb56a3a6191"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdZ93zOnstul7Yj86I1m1Sg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:27.767Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdZ93zOnstul7Yj86I1m1Sg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":378000,"raw":"378K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdZ93zOnstul7Yj86I1m1Sg","